{"kind":"html","caption":"用回溯从当前位置枚举所有非空前缀，只有前缀是回文串时，才把它加入当前方案并继续处理剩余字符。示例 \"aab\" 中，路径先得到 [\"a\",\"a\",\"b\"]，回退后再选择 \"aa\"，得到 [\"aa\",\"b\"]；\"aab\" 与 \"ab\" 因不是回文串而被剪枝。到达字符串末尾时记录方案，回退则撤销最近一次选择。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>分割回文串可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.hint{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.mono,.char,.piece,.answer{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.string-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;text-align:center;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s}\n.cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.done{border-color:#3794ff}\n.char{font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.index{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px}\n.role{font-size:10px;min-height:12px;margin-top:1px}\n.status{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.badge{padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:10px}\n.badge strong{color:#3794ff;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.path{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:4px;min-height:28px}\n.piece{padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #3794ff;border-radius:4px;background:#0e639c;color:#fff;font-size:11px}\n.empty{color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.arrow{color:#3794ff;font-size:11px}\n.candidate{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;margin-top:8px}\n.candidate.ok{border-color:#3794ff}\n.candidate.no{border-color:#f14c4c}\n.candidate-label{color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.candidate-value{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;margin:2px 0}\n.reason{font-size:10px;line-height:1.4}\n.ok .reason{color:#8d8d8d}.no .reason{color:#f48771}\n.answers{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}\n.answer{padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;opacity:.45;font-size:10px;transition:opacity .35s,background .35s}\n.answer.found{opacity:1;background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.tree{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.node{padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;background:#2d2d2d;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.node.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.node.cut{border-color:#f14c4c;color:#f48771}\n.footer{margin-top:8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45}\n.progress{margin-top:8px;height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden}\n.progress-bar{height:100%;width:0;background:#3794ff;transition:width .35s}\n.step-title{font-weight:600;font-size:13px}\n.step-note{margin-top:2px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:11px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h1>回溯 s = <span class=\"mono\">\"aab\"</span></h1>\n<div class=\"hint\">蓝格为当前候选子串。</div>\n<div class=\"string-row\" id=\"cells\" style=\"margin-top:6px\"></div>\n<div class=\"status\">\n<div class=\"badge\">起点 <strong id=\"start\">0</strong></div>\n<div class=\"badge\">终点 <strong id=\"end\">0</strong></div>\n<div class=\"badge\">动作 <strong id=\"action\">开始</strong></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\" style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px\">当前路径</div>\n<div class=\"path\" id=\"path\"></div>\n<div class=\"candidate\" id=\"candidate\">\n<div class=\"candidate-label\">检查</div>\n<div class=\"candidate-value\" id=\"candidateValue\">—</div>\n<div class=\"reason\" id=\"reason\">从第 0 个字符开始枚举前缀</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tree\" id=\"tree\"></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px\">答案</div>\n<div class=\"answers\">\n<div class=\"answer\" id=\"ans1\">[\"a\", \"a\", \"b\"]</div>\n<div class=\"answer\" id=\"ans2\">[\"aa\", \"b\"]</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"step-title\" id=\"stepTitle\">准备搜索</div>\n<div class=\"step-note\" id=\"stepNote\">选回文前缀后递归剩余部分。</div>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"progress-bar\" id=\"progress\"></div></div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"footer\">回文：两端向中间比较；到末尾则保存路径。</div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst chars=['a','a','b'];\nconst steps=[\n {range:[0,0],path:[],cand:'a',ok:true,start:0,end:0,action:'选择',title:'选择第一个 “a”',note:'单个字符一定是回文串，加入路径后从下标 1 继续。',nodes:['a']},\n {range:[1,1],path:['a'],cand:'a',ok:true,start:1,end:1,action:'选择',title:'再选择一个 “a”',note:'第二个单字符也是回文串，继续处理最后一个字符。',nodes:['a','a']},\n {range:[2,2],path:['a','a'],cand:'b',ok:true,start:2,end:2,action:'选择',title:'选择 “b”',note:'“b” 是回文串；选择后恰好到达字符串末尾。',nodes:['a','a','b']},\n {range:null,path:['a','a','b'],cand:'完整路径',ok:true,start:3,end:3,action:'记录答案',title:'得到第一个分割方案',note:'记录 [“a”, “a”, “b”]，随后回退并尝试更长的前缀。',nodes:['a','a','b'],answers:1},\n {range:[1,2],path:['a'],cand:'ab',ok:false,start:1,end:2,action:'剪枝',title:'“ab” 不是回文串',note:'两端字符 a 与 b 不同，这条分支无需继续递归。',nodes:['a','ab ×'],cut:true,answers:1},\n {range:[0,1],path:[],cand:'aa',ok:true,start:0,end:1,action:'选择',title:'回到根节点，选择 “aa”',note:'两端都是 a，因此 “aa” 是回文串，从下标 2 继续。',nodes:['aa'],answers:1},\n {range:[2,2],path:['aa'],cand:'b',ok:true,start:2,end:2,action:'选择',title:'在 “aa” 后选择 “b”',note:'到达末尾，当前路径构成另一种有效分割。',nodes:['aa','b'],answers:1},\n {range:null,path:['aa','b'],cand:'完整路径',ok:true,start:3,end:3,action:'记录答案',title:'得到第二个分割方案',note:'记录 [“aa”, “b”]，然后继续回退检查根节点的其余候选。',nodes:['aa','b'],answers:2},\n {range:[0,2],path:[],cand:'aab',ok:false,start:0,end:2,action:'剪枝',title:'“aab” 不是回文串',note:'首字符 a 与尾字符 b 不同。所有候选均已检查，搜索结束。',nodes:['aab ×'],cut:true,answers:2},\n {range:null,path:[],cand:'完成',ok:true,start:0,end:2,action:'结束',title:'枚举完成',note:'最终共有 2 个方案。动画稍后从头播放。',nodes:[],answers:2}\n];\nconst cells=document.getElementById('cells');\nchars.forEach((c,i)=>{cells.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<div class=\"cell\" data-i=\"${i}\"><div class=\"char\">${c}</div><div class=\"index\">${i}</div><div class=\"role\">未处理</div></div>`)});\nfunction render(s,idx){\n document.querySelectorAll('.cell').forEach((el,i)=>{\n  el.className='cell';\n  const role=el.querySelector('.role');\n  if(s.range&&i>=s.range[0]&&i<=s.range[1]){el.classList.add('active');role.textContent='候选'}\n  else if(i<s.start){el.classList.add('done');role.textContent='已选'}\n  else role.textContent='未处理';\n });\n document.getElementById('start').textContent=s.start;\n document.getElementById('end').textContent=s.end;\n document.getElementById('action').textContent=s.action;\n const path=document.getElementById('path');\n path.innerHTML=s.path.length?s.path.map((x,i)=>`${i?'<span class=\"arrow\">→</span>':''}<span class=\"piece\">${x}</span>`).join(''):'<span class=\"empty\">路径为空</span>';\n const box=document.getElementById('candidate');\n box.className='candidate '+(s.ok?'ok':'no');\n document.getElementById('candidateValue').textContent=s.cand;\n document.getElementById('reason').textContent=s.ok?(s.action==='记录答案'?'已覆盖整个字符串，可以保存':'回文检查通过，可以向下搜索'):'回文检查失败，立即剪枝';\n document.getElementById('stepTitle').textContent=s.title;\n document.getElementById('stepNote').textContent=s.note;\n document.getElementById('tree').innerHTML=s.nodes.map((n,i)=>`<span class=\"node ${s.cut&&i===s.nodes.length-1?'cut':'on'}\">${n}</span>`).join('');\n document.getElementById('ans1').className='answer '+((s.answers||0)>=1?'found':'');\n document.getElementById('ans2').className='answer '+((s.answers||0)>=2?'found':'');\n document.getElementById('progress').style.width=((idx+1)/steps.length*100)+'%';\n}\nlet current=0;render(steps[current],current);\nsetInterval(()=>{current=(current+1)%steps.length;render(steps[current],current)},2100);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
